              <lg xml:id="m-7c9e3678-9339-474a-ac57-e28a80b72976">
                <l xml:id="m-b95ab599-ab50-41df-8b91-43316787453b" facs="#m-3e1947e1-ff38-45b0-8ea4-9dea9287803e" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-7b60de8d-3c69-41db-a21b-53d78bc8ce19" facs="#m-ef561a51-39af-4a26-ae7f-802c5d01deb4" label="ambiguous">391</l><l xml:id="m-0dc75da1-5641-45fc-bcc2-b5d5f9290bbd" facs="#m-c4a479d9-9fd5-4720-b401-bb69d9a1b0fb" label="ambiguous">vit in</l><l xml:id="m-4ced1fce-00bf-4f29-a979-d2e049fe5125" facs="#m-da3a98fb-b377-4edd-9b8e-4f7a7d3a647d" label="lyrics-like">nó- bis : * Et ví-dimus gló-ri-am é¬</l><l xml:id="m-36642e04-93ce-4708-a74a-f24176d78a28" facs="#m-52a29d04-94a2-404b-be1b-7e6e70f7ba66" label="lyrics-like">jus, gló-ri-am quasi Unigéni-ti</l><l xml:id="m-5f1225a5-9b40-45e0-8c2d-124272391c30" facs="#m-da987594-42fe-41bf-bf1d-d2c5ceefe261" label="lyrics-like">plé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5cdfd217-d486-441e-9e87-ec53173dcf99" facs="#m-468aa304-da32-4a26-ba52-84046fcc3bef" label="lyrics-like">a Pâ-tre,</l><l xml:id="m-c86aed0b-52b0-41ad-874a-638bccc8009d" facs="#m-0a207283-d39d-488d-89bd-5cf0f4af9002" label="lyrics-like">tá- tis. V. Omni¬a</l><l xml:id="m-46f9e3c8-6743-4c7f-a98a-6fce6fcd5ebf" facs="#m-da48a1a0-afb9-45e5-bdc9-8ab36d2f20a3" label="lyrics-like">num grá¬ ti-ae et ve-ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-d55a2599-8160-4e38-a433-dc1a312f83d5" facs="#m-64056270-685d-4b9a-9885-bca5dd11bbaf" label="lyrics-like">per ípsum fácta sunt, et sine ípso fá-¬ ctum est</l><l xml:id="m-b02fc5c5-d037-4cb1-8fcc-421041f4b131" facs="#m-8af6b5ff-669a-4d54-bddf-574059e0f05a" label="lyrics-like">Pátri, et Fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-8e98ca7f-a983-4c51-85a1-a11bc26a828a" facs="#m-4c91f73c-75bd-49ac-a12e-a55d86371ff5" label="lyrics-like">"Et ví-dimus. Gló-ri¬a</l><l xml:id="m-ecf185bd-5b9b-4d37-aa52-c79c4877af8f" facs="#m-b37bd6da-54ef-47a1-9938-79330ebabd16" label="ambiguous">ni- hil.</l><l xml:id="m-ac666984-cebd-4f47-b5f0-81f0de4d6807" facs="#m-5ec78ada-fcb7-4656-b860-3337cb1dc08e" label="lyrics-like">"Et ví-dimus.</l><l xml:id="m-cf27121b-916f-455b-b6a4-40dea5bfd529" facs="#m-809c17fa-06a0-43a8-931e-9eb7985f6cb2" label="lyrics-like">li- 0, et Spi-rí- tu- i Sán- cto.</l><l xml:id="m-2f886b9f-8c85-4b11-9895-78b1e70d7e75" facs="#m-bc8ea6cf-d920-4c5f-bf71-02702453cebc" label="text-like">The Lector : Jube, domne, benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-9b80775d-76e9-456c-907d-4f06e3b7bb90" facs="#m-adf99c30-4a7e-4af1-a4b5-5e1e644d2328" label="lyrics-like">Blessing. Verba sancti Evangélii“dóceat nos Christus Filius Dei¬</l><l xml:id="m-dde2b9ef-f93f-4c62-bedd-f5cefe6e3c4a" facs="#m-b34cb1e3-09d2-462f-ab72-c8243d122d3d" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-00e21808-15b3-4e82-90c9-299efdc5df52" facs="#m-6140e37a-80b5-406f-900e-ec028ee92e4c" label="lyrics-like">Léctio sancti Evangélii secúndum Joánnem.</l><l xml:id="m-3c42771d-5bb8-44e5-acde-f30c902831ea" facs="#m-39a45b28-d799-491e-a8b8-e428fe3b0ce4" label="ambiguous">Chap. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-65604263-3fbd-4a1c-a3b4-eac32de44990" facs="#m-3c0d06db-9a89-40e7-8c37-92238b138e39" label="ambiguous">Lesson IX.</l><l xml:id="m-8194be80-e5ab-4c71-9889-a26f3bb1a00d" facs="#m-515f1186-bd6c-45a4-b406-4f602e67edc6" label="lyrics-like">N princípio erat Verbum, et Ver- per Verbum fecit ómnia? Si et Ver¬</l><l xml:id="m-725e13fb-4112-4124-91c2-da32e0b8fd65" facs="#m-4856fb20-3c46-4f01-8f6b-aac9af1b7e7d" label="ambiguous">L bum erat apud Deum, et Deus</l><l xml:id="m-c65eed7e-e063-474f-b1d8-444ffdfd4d30" facs="#m-58519b39-b212-4823-b926-9d658a22fdc9" label="ambiguous">bum Dei ipsum factum est; per quod</l><l xml:id="m-70e3f155-b888-4a81-a6a7-f1be9b0f4005" facs="#m-87ec218a-95e9-40e9-9a0b-7664449c4809" label="lyrics-like">áliud verbum factum est? Si hoc</l><l xml:id="m-343ef9de-ec52-4c63-88b6-b01604370b49" facs="#m-e2ac0ece-ebef-4bd2-a7a9-6253f9f36c6e" label="lyrics-like">erat Verbum. Et réliqua.</l><l xml:id="m-56b34830-fa5a-42b8-8635-90cf1fe15dc1" facs="#m-60de324f-e274-43a6-980e-c6285ef0ba46" label="ambiguous">dicis, quia hoc est verbum Verbi,</l><l xml:id="m-cfd801de-5c0e-49af-8604-1e04272149f1" facs="#m-edca078b-9075-4d49-8394-4d8ff7d6890d" label="lyrics-like">Homilia sancti Augustini Epíscopi.</l><l xml:id="m-8e164be0-a4bd-4eaa-bd7f-daec7adc0d85" facs="#m-c1c90b78-189e-4e43-90d3-bfdb5ab32eb2" label="ambiguous">per quod factum est illud; ipsum</l><l xml:id="m-c7691f99-d7ce-456f-99a1-386667fdfdf1" facs="#m-0d66b3e7-e89f-4bae-a6ee-d1e05698b5f5" label="lyrics-like">E vile áliquid putáres quale</l><l xml:id="m-d49ee986-8f90-4715-9758-740030501ec2" facs="#m-2df1e002-1730-4be8-912d-96f821920eac" label="lyrics-like">dico ego únicum Filium Dei. Si</l><l xml:id="m-e91118a3-93dc-4ac2-a98f-01190b9f85e6" facs="#m-9ed206ef-e2b9-4d27-b20c-2895bdd44c3a" label="lyrics-like">AL consuevísti cogitàre, cum verba</l><l xml:id="m-f55efec8-661f-4ace-8c0c-154e73d0f79c" facs="#m-e3db1c53-bee3-4de4-beee-ea226b56c8b9" label="ambiguous">autem non dicis verbum Verbi, con¬</l><l xml:id="m-3acb1307-549c-478f-8a35-cc9328b0eaa4" facs="#m-17f90198-0c32-4f82-899a-5de3eecb7a63" label="lyrics-like">humána soléres audire, audi quid</l><l xml:id="m-71f4f4a9-c06b-4bf6-a5a6-047937db3236" facs="#m-a896a669-c750-4076-b34a-20e78ecbb0fc" label="lyrics-like">céde non factum, per quod facta</l><l xml:id="m-66926599-7fb8-45af-bf75-c76df1839867" facs="#m-84cfc5d5-655a-4107-8edc-bf6d1f5710e8" label="lyrics-like">cógites: Deus erat Verbum. Exeat</l><l xml:id="m-dcfcce5d-8747-4b85-b982-ddb7849d8b8f" facs="#m-8f24c3e4-b765-4bfb-9348-80f5235e48b2" label="lyrics-like">sunt ómnia. Non enim per seípsum</l><l xml:id="m-656e83d8-d7b2-4abe-87e6-f08ba8ee1e70" facs="#m-8321b05c-2146-419e-b646-1e67331ea806" label="lyrics-like">nunc néscio quis infidélis Ariánus</l><l xml:id="m-57568908-a765-4b8f-8dbf-792c66a94c6f" facs="#m-10a23657-a4f8-474a-8a84-39e35b17664b" label="lyrics-like">fieri pótuit, per quod facta sunt</l><l xml:id="m-e73401b1-72cc-4e09-98e1-100963a0721e" facs="#m-2a450818-640c-4599-af91-f883fb9d5e1b" label="ambiguous">et dicat quia Verbum Dei factum</l><l xml:id="m-206be828-3d5f-4058-b01d-792142009fe3" facs="#m-8936af5e-64f7-4492-96a4-d9b1ddb0e652" label="lyrics-like">ómnia. Crede ergo Evangelistae.</l><l xml:id="m-91361705-f52a-4c56-a37c-f169ec313d6c" facs="#m-047d9785-524d-49bd-ad0b-b0b0e9a99818" label="lyrics-like">est. Quómodo potest fieri, ut Ver¬</l><l xml:id="m-f542a8e9-b35f-4f8f-84b8-e44b0d3b7ad1" facs="#m-805c3423-1b5c-451b-94ee-529a776e98b6" label="lyrics-like">Tu autem, Dómine, miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-8288693a-61c0-4be2-94ac-950481391b72" facs="#m-020360d7-c1d5-44b6-a24d-d5c20eb4d240" label="lyrics-like">R. Déo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-fca78306-f28e-4ef4-b1d8-308cb5c478a1" facs="#m-649b2dfa-b9b5-497c-a5a6-1be50ce29432" label="ambiguous">bum Dei factum sit, quando Deus</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
